### Get all positions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/positions
Accept: application/json

###
### Create position
### Change positionName/positionCode before re-running to avoid unique constraint conflicts.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/positions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "positionName": "Test Position",
  "positionCode": "P003",
  "level": "Junior",
  "baseSalary": 6500.00,
  "description": "test create position"
}

###
### Update position
### Replace 3 with the actual positionId returned by GET/POST.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/positions/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "positionName": "Test Position Updated",
  "positionCode": "P003",
  "level": "Senior",
  "baseSalary": 7200.00,
  "description": "test update position"
}

###
### Delete position
### Replace 3 with the actual positionId you want to delete.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/positions/3
Accept: application/json
